    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so fake to talk to people who aren't even there. like im just shouting into a void. it's not even like they're being mean to me or anything, they just... stopped. it's like i died and they just didn't bother to tell anyone. how am i supposed to keep pretending i'm still part of something when the reality is i've already been deleted?",
