      "content": "it's hard to find a quiet space when my head is just filled with this feeling that i shouldn't even be here. if i'm already invisible to everyone else, then what's the point of the physical part? it feels like i'm just lingering in a world that already moved on without me. like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the part that's already gone.",
